ccess rate, yards/play, field position, finishing drives, explosive differential, postgame win expectancy.\n\n**“Clemson is horrible despite the name”** → current-performance versus program-reputation divergence, coaching-cycle stability, roster retention, recruiting/talent versus realized production.\n\nThat is how we get from **Don sees it** to **EC⁸ can measure it**.\n\nWe still absolutely need the formal NCAA data dictionary. But now, instead of inventing a giant database first and hoping it contains what matters, today's games are telling us what fields the database actually needs.\n\nSTATUS: PROCEED  \nCONFIDENCE: 99%  \nREASON: Live conversational analysis is successfully exposing candidate variables and measurable proxies before the NCAA data specification is frozen.  \nNEXT GATE: Continue game-by-game ingestion → consolidate repeated signals → draft NCAA Football Data Elements v0.1  \nDON INPUT NEEDED: No", "text_chars": 2073, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "79a972d3-46ef-45fa-9646-1d8c843c63ea", "role": "system", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789846688.453082, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 0, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 1, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "5690e715-47c6-433f-989e-b9c22670fafc", "role": "system", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789846688.602893, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 0, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-